        "created_at": "2018-07-28T12:32:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Okay, I think I got it!</p><p>But wait, does that mean then that with Headlock you could Headlock something to make all damage to it irreducible, but then leave the Battle Zone so Mainstay isn't there to redirect to? The card itself causes the effect as opposed to Mainstay himself, and would stay behind, so the first portion would still be valid, but since Mainstay's not there to redirect to the latter part is invalid?</p><p>Mainstay's Cross-Country Headlock sounds like it could be very useful.</p>",
